{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は東京ビッグサイトにて個別握手会がありましたよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手会一番最後に終わったの。\n皆様の優しさが伝わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈を応援したいと言って下さる方が確かにいるから私はステージに立つ事が出来るんです。\n全てを完璧にする事はきっと大変だし、でも少しずつでもよくなる様に前に進むのみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！\nお留守の皆様に！\n握手会のお洋服＆エアー握手会開催します＼('Д')／ﾝﾊﾞｯ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行りの千鳥柄\n赤いヒールがお気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとちょっと違うエアー握手ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛伸びたよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/22/2595373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤いリップも自分の中で流行ってます\nでもANNA SUIのじゃないの（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！\nへばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}